<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαίομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαμαι,</span> only
		pres. and impf.: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> in bad sense (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. acc. rei,
				<i>to be indignant at,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαιομένου κακὰ ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.16
				</span></i>
			: <i>look on with jealousy</i> or <i>envy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἀγαίομαι θεῶν ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. dat. pers.,
				<i>to be wroth</i> or <i>indignant with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ . . Ζεὺς αὐτὸς ἀγαίεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					333
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαιόμενοί τε καὶ φθονέοντες αὐτῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.69
				</span></i>
			 (cf. Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.16
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in good
			sense, <i>admire,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span> Opp <i><span class="en">
				<u>H.</u>
				4.138
			</span></i>; abs. in part., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.899
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.1016
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ ἀγαιομένη κούρῳ Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					204
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγαίετο θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					81.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
